---
// Space for a friend's challenge (?vs= in the link). Hidden unless the page's early head script finds one, so it is
// laid out before the first paint and nothing moves; scripts/daily.ts fills in the friend's result.
---
<section class="card challenge-card" id="challenge" aria-label="Challenge from a friend">
  <span class="pill p-y">Challenge!</span>
  <div class="grow"><h2 class="h-s">A friend challenged you</h2>
  <p class="challenge-line">They got <span id="challenge-line">a great result</span>. Can you beat it?</p>
  <p class="muted" style="margin:0">Same puzzle as theirs. You’ll see both results when you finish.</p></div>
</section>
